		<array>
			<string>comgooglemaps</string>
			<string>iosamap</string>
		</array>
		<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
		<true/>
		<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Memorion connects directly to your recorder over Wi-Fi to download recordings faster.</string>
		<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Bluetooth permission is required to connect with your Memorion.</string>
		<key>NSBluetoothPeripheralUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Bluetooth permission is required to connect with your Memorion.</string>
		<key>NSCalendarsFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Memorion reads your calendar events — titles, times, and locations — so its AI assistant can answer questions about your schedule. For example, you can ask "when is my next meeting?" or "was I free last Tuesday afternoon?". Events are synced to your Memorion account to enable this. Memorion never adds, edits, or deletes calendar events, and never reads event notes or attendees.</string>
		<key>NSCalendarsUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Memorion reads your calendar events — titles, times, and locations — so its AI assistant can answer questions about your schedule. For example, you can ask "when is my next meeting?" or "was I free last Tuesday afternoon?". Events are synced to your Memorion account to enable this. Memorion never adds, edits, or deletes calendar events, and never reads event notes or attendees.</string>
		<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Memorion uses the microphone to record and transcribe your conversations in real-time.</string>
		<key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Memorion uses on-device speech recognition for local transcription of your conversations.</string>
		<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Memorion needs access to your photo library to save and share moment images.</string>
		<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
		<string>Memorion needs permission to save moment images to your photo library.</string>
		<key>NSRemindersUsageDescription</key>
		<string>We need access to your reminders to export action items from Memorion conversations.</string>
		<key>NSRemindersFullAccessUsageDescription</key>
		<string>We need access to your reminders to export action items from Memorion conversations.</string>
		<key>PermissionGroupNotification</key>
		<string>You need to enable notifications to receive your pro-active feedback.</string>
